 like he'll end up saving  his life we don't find out here instead  what we end up doing is switching over  to the fight between itsu and wolverine  when isu possessed by omega red goes in  for the attack and it's one of those  things where wolverine is doing  everything he can to basically  neutralize her without having to kill  her but knowing omega red as he knows  him and knowing how capable itsu is as a  fighter wolverine seemingly realizes the  only way to stop this is to kill itsu  and so what it looks like marvel's doing  here is unlike the origin of daycan and  like the death of itsu as it was  originally told which was that itsu was  killed by seemingly saber tooth i think  that instead it actually ends up being  wolverine who has to kill her and  wolverine is the one who's responsible  for the death of dakin's mom and so it's  it's that's this is why i say i feel  like marvel's gonna be going through and  changing the history of wolverine  changing his origin up right just kind  of switching things around i don't know  if that's gonna be the case or not but  let me know what you guys think down in  the comments section either way thank  you guys for watching this video and i  will catch you all later  peace
 

